{"task_id": "HumanEval/57", "solution": "```python\ndef monotonic(l: list):\n    \"\"\"Return True if list elements are monotonically increasing or decreasing.\"\"\"\n    if len(l) <= 1:\n        return True\n\n    is_increasing = True\n    is_decreasing = True\n\n    for i in range(len(l) - 1):\n        if l[i] > l[i+1]:\n            is_increasing = False\n        if l[i] < l[i+1]:\n            is_decreasing = False\n\n        # Optimization: if both flags are false, we can stop early.\n        if not is_increasing and not is_decreasing:\n            return False\n\n    return is_increasing or is_decreasing\n```"}
